# Making Movement Frame‑Rate Independent

`Time.deltaTime` is the time in seconds since the last frame. Multiply your speed by it:

```csharp
void Update()
{
    float speed = 5f;
    transform.Translate(0, 0, speed * Time.deltaTime);
}
```

Now the object moves **5 units per second**, smooth on any hardware. `Time.deltaTime` will be ~0.016 at 60 FPS, ~0.033 at 30 FPS.

